{"seq":3,"slug":"type-sharing","title":"类型共享","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/shared-packages/type-sharing","wordCount":805,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"类型共享\">类型共享</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>类型共享</strong>让多个包使用同一份类型定义，把前后端数据契约收敛为&quot;单一事实来源&quot;。它的核心是三个概念：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>共享类型包</td>\n<td>只含类型定义、无运行时代码的包</td>\n<td>跨包类型安全的基座</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Declaration Files</td>\n<td><code>.d.ts</code> 声明文件</td>\n<td>发布模式下类型入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>import type</code></td>\n<td>编译期擦除的类型导入</td>\n<td>不引入运行时依赖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键取舍在<strong>开发体验与发布兼容</strong>之间：源码直引对开发最友好但无法发布；构建 + <code>.d.ts</code> 可发布但需先构建；<code>publishConfig</code> 覆盖 <code>exports</code> 则让同一份包在开发时指向源码、发布时切换到构建产物，兼顾两者。路径解析上，现代方案是 <code>moduleResolution: &quot;bundler&quot;</code> 配合 workspace 符号链接与 <code>exports</code> 字段，无需手写 <code>paths</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"类型共享的价值\">类型共享的价值</h2><p>在 TypeScript Monorepo 中，<strong>类型共享</strong>（Type Sharing）是跨包协作的核心机制。当 <code>@myorg/api</code> 定义了 API 响应的数据结构，<code>@myorg/web</code> 和 <code>@myorg/admin</code> 都需要使用这些类型来确保前后端数据契约的一致性。没有类型共享，每个包各自定义类型，不一致的风险将随包数量线性增长。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    TYPES[&quot;@myorg/types&lt;br/&gt;共享类型定义&quot;]&#10;    API[&quot;@myorg/api&lt;br/&gt;后端服务&quot;]&#10;    WEB[&quot;@myorg/web&lt;br/&gt;前端主站&quot;]&#10;    ADMIN[&quot;@myorg/admin&lt;br/&gt;管理后台&quot;]&#10;&#10;    TYPES --&gt; API&#10;    TYPES --&gt; WEB&#10;    TYPES --&gt; ADMIN&#10;\">graph TB\n    TYPES[\"@myorg/types&lt;br/&gt;共享类型定义\"]\n    API[\"@myorg/api&lt;br/&gt;后端服务\"]\n    WEB[\"@myorg/web&lt;br/&gt;前端主站\"]\n    ADMIN[\"@myorg/admin&lt;br/&gt;管理后台\"]\n\n    TYPES --&gt; API\n    TYPES --&gt; WEB\n    TYPES --&gt; ADMIN\n</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"共享类型包的设计\">共享类型包的设计</h2><p>一个专门的类型共享包是最简洁的方案。它只包含类型定义，不包含运行时代码，因此不需要构建步骤：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/types&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;1.0.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;module&quot;,&#10;  &quot;exports&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;.&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;types&quot;: &quot;./src/index.ts&quot;,&#10;      &quot;default&quot;: &quot;./src/index.ts&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;./api&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;types&quot;: &quot;./src/api.ts&quot;,&#10;      &quot;default&quot;: &quot;./src/api.ts&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;./db&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;types&quot;: &quot;./src/db.ts&quot;,&#10;      &quot;default&quot;: &quot;./src/db.ts&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"module\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"exports\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \".\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/index.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/index.ts\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"./api\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/api.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/api.ts\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"./db\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/db.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/db.ts\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// packages/types/src/api.ts&#10;export interface ApiResponse&lt;T&gt; {&#10;  code: number;&#10;  data: T;&#10;  message: string;&#10;  timestamp: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;export interface PaginatedResponse&lt;T&gt; extends ApiResponse&lt;T[]&gt; {&#10;  pagination: {&#10;    page: number;&#10;    pageSize: number;&#10;    total: number;&#10;    totalPages: number;&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;export interface User {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  name: string;&#10;  email: string;&#10;  role: &#39;admin&#39; | &#39;editor&#39; | &#39;viewer&#39;;&#10;  createdAt: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;export interface Product {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  title: string;&#10;  price: number;&#10;  status: &#39;draft&#39; | &#39;published&#39; | &#39;archived&#39;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// packages/types/src/api.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ApiResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shi