/span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.d.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"import\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.mjs\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>开发体验</th>\n<th>发布兼容</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>源码直引</td>\n<td>最好（即时反馈）</td>\n<td>❌ 不能发布</td>\n<td>纯内部包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建 + dts</td>\n<td>需要先构建</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>需要发布的包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>publishConfig 覆盖</td>\n<td>最好</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>既内部使用又需发布</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"路径映射配置\">路径映射配置</h2><p>TypeScript 的<strong>路径映射</strong>（Path Mapping）在 Monorepo 中有多种配置方式：</p>\n<h3 id=\"tsconfig-paths-传统方式\">tsconfig paths（传统方式）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;baseUrl&quot;: &quot;.&quot;,&#10;    &quot;paths&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;@myorg/ui&quot;: [&quot;../../packages/ui/src&quot;],&#10;      &quot;@myorg/ui/*&quot;: [&quot;../../packages/ui/src/*&quot;],&#10;      &quot;@myorg/utils&quot;: [&quot;../../packages/utils/src&quot;],&#10;      &quot;@myorg/types&quot;: [&quot;../../packages/types/src&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"baseUrl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"paths\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"@myorg/ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../../packages/ui/src\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"@myorg/ui/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../../packages/ui/src/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"@myorg/utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../../packages/utils/src\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"@myorg/types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"../../packages/types/src\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"依赖-workspace-链接-推荐方式\">依赖 workspace 链接（推荐方式）</h3><p>现代 Monorepo 工具链推荐直接依赖 workspace 的符号链接，配合包的 <code>exports</code> 字段，无需手动配置 paths：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;moduleResolution&quot;: &quot;bundler&quot;,&#10;    &quot;module&quot;: &quot;ESNext&quot;,&#10;    &quot;strict&quot;: true&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"moduleResolution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bundler\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"module\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ESNext\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"strict\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    CODE[&quot;import { Button } from &#39;@myorg/ui&#39;&quot;]&#10;    RESOLVE[&quot;模块解析&quot;]&#10;    SYMLINK[&quot;node_modules/@myorg/ui&lt;br/&gt;→ ../../packages/ui&quot;]&#10;    EXPORTS[&quot;exports 字段&lt;br/&gt;→ ./src/index.ts&quot;]&#10;    SOURCE[&quot;packages/ui/src/index.ts&quot;]&#10;&#10;    CODE --&gt; RESOLVE --&gt; SYMLINK --&gt; EXPORTS --&gt; SOURCE\">flowchart LR\n    CODE[\"import { Button } from '@myorg/ui'\"]\n    RESOLVE[\"模块解析\"]\n    SYMLINK[\"node_modules/@myorg/ui&lt;br/&gt;→ ../../packages/ui\"]\n    EXPORTS[\"exports 字段&lt;br/&gt;→ ./src/index.ts\"]\n    SOURCE[\"packages/ui/src/index.ts\"]\n\n    CODE --&gt; RESOLVE --&gt; SYMLINK --&gt; EXPORTS --&gt; SOURCE</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>moduleResolution: &quot;bundler&quot;</code> 是现代 Monorepo 的推荐配置，它支持 <code>exports</code> 字段解析和条件导出，无需手动配置路径映射。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((类型共享))&#10;    共享类型包&#10;      纯类型定义&#10;      无需构建&#10;      子路径导出&#10;    Declaration Files&#10;      源码直引&#10;      tsup --dts&#10;      publishConfig 覆盖&#10;    路径映射&#10;      workspace 链接&#10;      moduleResolution bundler&#10;      exports 字段&#10;    最佳实践&#10;      import type&#10;      类型即契约&#10;      前后端一致\">mindmap\n  root((类型共享))\n    共享类型包\n      纯类型定义\n      无需构建\n      子路径导出\n    Declaration Files\n      源码直引\n      tsup --dts\n      publishConfig 覆盖\n    路径映射\n      workspace 链接\n      moduleResolution bundler\n      exports 字段\n    最佳实践\n      import type\n      类型即契约\n      前后端一致</pre><ul>\n<li>共享类型包是 TypeScript Monorepo 跨包类型安全的基础，应使用纯类型定义无需构建</li>\n<li>开发模式下包可直接指向 TypeScript 源码，发布时通过 <code>publishConfig</code> 切换到构建产物</li>\n<li><code>moduleResolution: &quot;bundler&quot;</code> 配合 workspace 链接和 <code>exports</code> 字段，是现代 Monorepo 路径解析的推荐方案</li>\n<li>始终使用 <code>import type</code> 导入类型，确保类型导入不引入运行时依赖</li>\n<li>共享类型是前后端数据契约的&quot;单一事实来源&quot;，修改一处即可在编译时发现所有不一致</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"类型共享","id":"类型共享"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"类型共享的价值","id":"类型共享的价值"},{"level":2,"text":"共享类型包的设计","id":"共享类型包的设计"},{"level":2,"text":"消费方的使用方式","id":"消费方的使用方式"},{"level":2,"text":"Declaration Files 策略","id":"declaration-files-策略"},{"level":3,"text":"策略一：源码直引（开发模式）","id":"策略一-源码直引-开发模式"},{"level":3,"text":"策略二：构建 + 声明文件（发布模式）","id":"策略二-构建-声明文件-发布模式"},{"level":3,"text":"策略三：双入口（publishConfig 覆盖）","id":"策略三-双入口-publishconfig-覆盖"},{"level":2,"text":"路径映射配置","id":"路径映射配置"},{"level":3,"text":"tsconfig paths（传统方式）","id":"tsconfig-paths-传统方式"},{"level":3,"text":"依赖 workspace 链接（推荐方式）","id":"依赖-workspace-链接-推荐方式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"版本策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/shared-packages/versioning-strategy"},"next":{"title":"发布工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/shared-packages/publishing-workflow"}}